    val MAP: Map<String, String> = mapOf(
        "Stand silently and listen to the imam. Do not recite al-Fatihah or a surah, whether he recites aloud or quietly." to "Simama kimya na umsikilize imamu. Usisome al-Fatihah wala surah, awe anasoma kwa sauti au kwa utulivu.",
