        "Any surah you know may be recited. Keep the order of the Quran: the surah of the second rak‘ah should come after that of the first." to "Sura yoyote unayoijua inaweza kusomwa. Shika utaratibu wa Quran: surah ya rakaa ya pili inapaswa kuja baada ya ile ya kwanza.",
        "Recite Bismillah, Surah al-Fatihah and another surah, as in the first rak‘ah." to "Soma Bismillah, Surah al-Fatihah na surah nyingine, kama katika rakaa ya kwanza.",
        "In Sunnah, Nafl and Witr a surah is added after al-Fatihah in every rak‘ah." to "Katika Sunnah, Nafl na Witr surah inaongezwa baada ya al-Fatihah katika kila rakaa.",
        "Recite Bismillah and Surah al-Fatihah only. No surah is added in the third and fourth rak‘at of a Fard prayer." to "Soma Bismillah na Surah al-Fatihah pekee. Hakuna surah inayoongezwa katika rakaa ya tatu na ya nne ya sala ya Fard.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut" to "Dua-e-Qunut",
        "After the surah of the third rak‘ah, raise the hands {hands} saying Allahu Akbar, fold them again and recite Dua-e-Qunut quietly. Then go into ruku‘." to "Baada ya surah ya rakaa ya tatu, inua mikono {hands} ukisema Allahu Akbar, ikunjane tena na usome Dua-e-Qunut kimya kimya. Kisha ingia kwenye rukuu.",
        "If you have not memorised it yet, recite ‘Rabbana atina…’ or say ‘Allahummaghfir li’ three times, and keep learning it." to "Ikiwa bado haujaikariri, soma ‘Rabbana atina…’ au sema ‘Allahummaghfir li’ mara tatu, na uendelee kujifunza.",
        "Ruku‘" to "Rukuu",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow. Grip the knees with the fingers spread, keep the back level and the head in line with it. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Sema Allahu Akbar na rukuu. Shika magoti na vidole vilivyoenea, weka kiwango cha nyuma na kichwa kulingana nayo. Soma tasbihi angalau mara tatu.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow only as far as the hands reach the knees. Rest the hands on the knees with the fingers together, keep the arms close to the body and do not straighten the back fully. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Sema Allahu Akbar na rukuuni mpaka mikono ifike magotini tu. Pumzika mikono kwa magoti pamoja na vidole, weka mikono karibu na mwili na usinyooshe nyuma kikamilifu. Soma tasbihi angalau mara tatu.",
        "Qawmah (standing up)" to "Qawmah (kusimama)",
        "Rise saying Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, stand fully upright with the arms at the sides, and say Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Inuka ukisema Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, simama wima kabisa na mikono ikiwa kando, na sema Rabbana wa lakal-hamd.",
        "When the imam says Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, rise, stand fully upright and say only Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Imamu anaposema Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, inuka, simama wima kabisa na useme Rabbana wa lakal-hamd tu.",
        "Pause until every joint has settled before going down." to "Sitisha hadi kila kiungo kitulie kabla ya kushuka.",
        "Two sajdahs" to "Sajda mbili",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down: knees first, then hands, then nose and forehead between the hands. Keep the elbows raised, the arms away from the sides, the belly away from the thighs, and the toes pressed towards the Qibla. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Sema Allahu Akbar na ushuke chini: piga magoti kwanza, kisha mikono, kisha pua na paji la uso baina ya mikono. Weka viwiko vilivyoinuliwa, mikono iwe mbali na kando, tumbo mbali na mapaja, na vidole vya miguu vikikandamizwa kuelekea Qibla. Soma tasbihi angalau mara tatu.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down into sajdah drawn together: the arms resting on the ground close to the sides, the belly on the thighs and both feet turned out to the right. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Sema Allahu Akbar na ushuke kwenye sajdah ukiwa umevutwa pamoja: mikono ikiegemea ardhini karibu na pande, tumbo kwenye mapaja na miguu yote miwili ikielekea kulia. Soma tasbihi angalau mara tatu.",
        "Rise with Allahu Akbar and sit upright for a moment (Jalsa). You may say Rabbighfir li." to "Inuka pamoja na Allahu Akbar na ukae wima kwa muda (Jalsa). Unaweza kusema Rabbighfir li.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and make the second sajdah in the same way." to "Sema Allahu Akbar na ufanye sajda ya pili vivyo hivyo.",
