        "Then stand up for the next rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar, without sitting or leaning on the ground." to "Kisha simama kwa ajili ya rakaa inayofuata ukisema Allahu Akbar, bila ya kukaa au kuegemea ardhi.",
        "First sitting (Qa‘dah Ula)" to "Kikao cha kwanza (Qa‘dah Ula)",
        "Recite only the Tashahhud." to "Soma Tashahhud tu.",
        "Then stand for the third rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar." to "Kisha simama kwa rakaa ya tatu ukisema Allahu Akbar.",
        "In four rak‘at of Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah or Nafl, also recite Durood and dua here and begin the third rak‘ah with Thana. In Sunnah Muakkadah recite only the Tashahhud." to "Katika rakaa nne za Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah au Nafl, pia soma Durood na dua hapa na uanze rakaa ya tatu kwa Thana. Katika Sunnah Muakkadah soma Tashahhud tu.",
        "Final sitting (Qa‘dah Akhirah)" to "Kikao cha mwisho (Qa‘dah Akhirah)",
