        "Either of the two duas shown is enough." to "Ama dua mbili zilizoonyeshwa inatosha.",
        "Salam" to "Salaam",
        "Turn the face to the right and say As-salamu ‘alaykum wa rahmatullah, then to the left and say it again. The prayer is complete." to "Geuza uso kulia na useme As-salamu ‘alaykum wa rahmatullah, kisha kushoto na useme tena. Sala imekamilika.",
        "Give each salam just after the imam, never before him." to "Toa kila salamu baada ya imamu, kamwe usimtangulia.",
        "After the salam" to "Baada ya salam",
