        "After a Fard that is followed by Sunnah (Zuhr, Maghrib, Isha), make a short dua, pray the Sunnah, and recite these afterwards." to "Baada ya Fard inayofuatwa na Sunnah (Dhuhr, Maghrib, Isha), fanya dua fupi, uswali Sunnah, na usome hizi baadae.",
