        "Taharah: the body, the clothes and the place of prayer are clean, and you are in wudu, or have made ghusl where it is due." to "Tahara: mwili, nguo na sehemu ya kuswalia ni safi, na wewe uko katika wudhu, au umefanya ghusl pale inapostahiki.",
        "Satr-e-awrah: a man covers from the navel to below the knees; a woman covers her whole body except the face, the hands and the feet." to "Satr-e-awrah: mtu hufunika kutoka kitovu hadi chini ya magoti; mwanamke hufunika mwili wake wote isipokuwa uso, mikono na miguu.",
