        "Ta‘dil-e-arkan: staying still in ruku‘, qawmah, sajdah and jalsa for at least one ‘Subhanallah’." to "Ta‘dil-e-arkan: kukaa tuli katika rukuu’, qawmah, sajdah na jalsa kwa angalau ‘Subhanallah’ moja.",
        "Qa‘dah Ula, the first sitting in a three- or four-rak‘at prayer, and reciting the full Tashahhud in both sittings." to "Qa‘dah Ula, wa kwanza kukaa katika swala ya rakaa tatu au nne, na kusoma Tashahhud kamili katika vikao vyote viwili.",
        "Adding nothing after the Tashahhud in the first sitting of Fard, Witr and Sunnah Muakkadah." to "Hakuongeza chochote baada ya Tashahhud katika kikao cha kwanza cha Fard, Witr na Sunnah Muakkadah.",
